# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: the middle and the east

step Fire Plume Ridge and the eastern jungle
  tip Ride south to Fire Plume Ridge in the middle of the crater, then east into the eastern jungle. Crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many of them around Fire Plume Ridge: take a few extra of each colour. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers drop the petals; the expedition's Crate of Foodstuffs sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle.
  collect 11316 quest 4141            -- Bloodpetal
  collect 11830 quest 4503

